  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: UNBREAKABLE
  body: 'Not everything can be destroyed.

    If you press Z on the barricade and
    send troops at it, they walk up, find they cannot hurt it, pause and return.

    The
    loot behind it is not sealed. Troops sent at the gold find a way around the fence.'
  radius: 4
