  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: 'JOB 3: THE ARMORY'
  body: 'GOAL: collect the gear inside the walled armory.

    HOW: it is sealed
    and troops cannot reach it. It opens when a cart arrives at the ring. Then tap-send
    troops at the gear. A troop can wear up to 4 pieces.

    RESULT: an Army strength
    popup appears for every piece equipped.'
  radius: 4
