  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6dffaeb1f6b7ca4cb5ce48f87980a3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: 'STEP 5: THE TEMPLE'
  body: 'GOAL: defeat the temple guardian and take the treasure.

    HOW: the door
    south of this pad opens when all three runes are lit. The guardian is a miniboss
    with 1500 health, 5 attach points and two escorts. It hits for 40, so troops
    die fast. Send a mixed group: melee fill the 5 points, ranged add safe damage.
    A lone front attacker gets countered, so go in as a group. Recall hurt troops
    and send fresh ones.

    RESULT: when it falls, treasure appears inside the
    temple and the mission is complete.'
  radius: 4
